<header class="page-hero page-hero--compact wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Customer information</p><h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1><p>Last reviewed: August 2026. This Phase 2 foundation records confirmed ordering and delivery facts; final legal language will be owner-reviewed before production launch.</p></header><article class="legal wrap section"><section><h2>Custom cake orders and quotations</h2><p>Every custom cake is made to order. A quotation is based on the agreed design, size, details and celebration date. Availability is not secured until the order is confirmed.</p></section><section><h2>Advance and order confirmation</h2><p>A 50% advance is required to confirm an order and reserve the agreed date. The remaining 50% must be completed before pickup or before a delivery cab is booked.</p></section><section><h2>Pickup and assisted cab delivery</h2><p>Pickup is available from Manikonda, Hyderabad. PureBakes can assist with arranging cab delivery; applicable cab charges are the customer’s responsibility. For cab delivery, the full cake payment must be cleared before the cab is booked.</p></section><section><h2>Design variations</h2><p>Custom cakes are handcrafted. Minor variations may occur while preserving the agreed overall direction. Reference images communicate inspiration and are not automatically promises of an exact copy.</p></section><section><h2>Changes, cancellations and refunds</h2><p><strong>Owner review required:</strong> final timeframes, change limits, cancellation terms and refund rules will be published after confirmation. Contact PureBakes before placing an order if these terms affect your event planning.</p></section><section><h2>Storage and handling</h2><p><strong>Owner review required:</strong> cake-specific transport, storage and serving guidance will be provided with the order where applicable.</p></section></article>
